# GitHub push

When the user asks to save, update, or ship work, commit relevant files and **push to `origin` immediately**. Do not ask again whether to push.

- Remote: `https://github.com/sumitbolla7/ChoiceTime.git`
- Default branch: `main`
- Never force-push `main`. Never skip hooks unless the user asks.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials).
